## Project-specific safety and privacy notice

- This application is decision-support software, not a certified navigation system, official nautical chart, ECDIS, radar, AIS receiver, sonar, emergency beacon, or vessel-control system. It is provided without a guarantee of accuracy, availability, or fitness for safe navigation.
- GNSS, weather, current, wave, bathymetry, reef objects, route, MOB, SOS, and AI outputs may be incomplete, delayed, unavailable, or inaccurate. Users remain responsible for lookout, navigation decisions, communications, and applicable maritime procedures. MOB/SOS tools prepare local information; they do not automatically contact emergency services.
- The anonymous profile UUID is an application identifier, not a hardware serial number or IMEI. Live GPS sharing is disabled by default and requires explicit user consent. When enabled, precise position and vessel details may be visible to other online users; the owner is responsible for enabling, reviewing, and stopping that publication. Location sharing with AI is a separate permission.
- Users are responsible for API keys, credentials, personal/vessel data, and third-party content they enter or transmit. Never commit secrets, release keystores, passwords, or service-role keys to this repository.
- Project name, logos, artwork, sponsor marks, QRIS assets, and other trademarks are not granted under the MIT license unless explicitly stated by their respective owners.
